    </task>
    <task id="Id_1f17e6c6-63f3-4c38-9e0b-8010ec90b754" name="5.2.4 Compilar a informação para o convite">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O conte&amp;uacute;do da licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para o gerenciamento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es deve ser combinado com outras informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do processo licitat&amp;oacute;rio que est&amp;atilde;o sendo emitidos para disponibiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para as licitantes tais como: termo de refer&amp;ecirc;ncia, pe&amp;ccedil;as t&amp;eacute;cncias, especifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es t&amp;eacute;cnicas , etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Desta forma, considerar:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. os requisitos de troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da contraatante;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. as infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de refer&amp;ecirc;ncia relevantes e os recusos compartilhados;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. os requisitos e crit&amp;eacute;rios de avalia&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da resposta &amp;agrave; licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;4. as datas-marco de entrega da informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;5. o padr&amp;atilde;o de infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projeto;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;6. os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos da produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projetos; e &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;7. o protocolo de inofmra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projeto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_521abc87-c3d2-4271-8fa5-a4a7ea8c858a</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_d896b8a5-ebf9-425c-b418-1c8b2aaa47a1</outgoing>
      <resourceRole id="Id_cf7f4560-06f4-4420-b79f-cd1ed0db82fb">
        <q10:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q10="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">EnteFederativo</q10:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_35cdb8c4-b10c-409c-a81f-9dcb82de3be2" name="5.2.3 Estabelecer requisitos e critérios de avaliação">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A contratante determina os requisitos m&amp;iacute;nimos que a poss&amp;iacute;vel licitante deve atender e comunicar em sua resposta &amp;agrave; proposta. Ao&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;mesmo tempo, estabelece como avaliar&amp;aacute; a efic&amp;aacute;cia com que esses requisitos m&amp;iacute;nimos s&amp;atilde;o abordados nas respostas &amp;agrave;s propostas recebidas. Isso fornece &amp;agrave; poss&amp;iacute;vel licitante um grau de orienta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o sobre o que ela deve detalhar em sua resposta &amp;agrave; proposta e permite uma avalia&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o consistente e justa das propostas recebidas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;Eacute; prov&amp;aacute;vel que as principais considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es sejam:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1) O plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM detalha suficientemente a estrat&amp;eacute;gia de federa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o proposta pela equipe de entrega, &amp;eacute; vi&amp;aacute;vel e pr&amp;aacute;tico?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2) A compet&amp;ecirc;ncia, a capacidade e a habilidade da poss&amp;iacute;vel licitante para atender aos requisitos de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3) Como a equipe de entrega do projeto ser&amp;aacute; mobilizada, pensando em obter recursos e tecnologia prontos para serem implantados. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;4) A considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da licitante sobre a gest&amp;atilde;o de risco associado a entrega da infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
