    <task id="Id_0c276974-3e3a-4e56-8a62-a83e857a94f2" name="5.2.1 Definir os requisitos de troca de informação ">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A contratante deve estabelecer seus requisitos de troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Os Requisitos de troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es (EIR) abrangentes e adequadamente gerenciados s&amp;atilde;o fundamentais para o sucesso do gerenciamento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es. Eles fornecem a estrutura para toda e qualquer equipe de entrega ativa em um projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Cada EIR &amp;eacute; uma especifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o que detalha as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es exigidas pela contratante para todas as trocas de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es com as contratadas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;H&amp;aacute; v&amp;aacute;rias atividades na cl&amp;aacute;usula 5.2.1 que a contratante precisa realizar para garantir que cada EIR seja totalmente definido.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;a) estabelecer os requisitos de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da contratante a serem atendidos durante o contrato;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;b) estabelecer o n&amp;iacute;vel necess&amp;aacute;rio de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o requerido para atener a cada requisito de infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;c) estabelecer os crit&amp;eacute;rios de aceita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para cada requisitos de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;d) estabelecer as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de suporte que os potenciais licitantes l&amp;iacute;deres possam necessitar para entender completamente ou avaliar cada requisito de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ou seu crit&amp;eacute;rio de aceita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;e) estabelecer as datas, relativas as datas marco de entrega da infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projeto e pontos chave de decis&amp;atilde;o da contratante, na qual cada requisito dever&amp;aacute; ser atendido.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
